From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:53:22 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Meridian: Studio's feed gets its steps before the first
 permission question (the transcript from the session's first hook)

Mission Control learned a session's transcript only from its status line.
Claude Code may not draw one before its first permission question (and the
E2E stand-in draws none), so Studio's studioTranscript had no file and the
feed stayed empty until then: the question, the answer and the file cards
came from Mission Control, the steps never. Every hook event names the
transcript (transcript_path); the hook now passes it on and Mission Control
keeps it from SessionStart on (a subagent's events are skipped; /clear's new
file replaces it).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
